# Plan-doc byte budgets (ADR-009). Prettier pads every markdown table cell to the
# widest cell in its column, which inflated docs/QUEUE.md several-fold (757 KB padded
# vs ~202 KB collapsed on 2026-10-06) — far past its 20,480-byte cap — and the
# pre-commit `prettier --check` gate forces that padding back on every commit.
# The QUEUE index is written unpadded on purpose. The snapshot archives
# (QUEUE-<date>[-N].md rotated rows, STATE-<date>[-N].md retired narrative) must
# stay byte-verbatim: rotation's losslessness check compares them to the source.
docs/QUEUE.md
docs/history/QUEUE-*.md
docs/history/STATE-*.md
